 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Check their reviews, both from friends and on rating sites. A mix of high and low ratings usually means it's mixed, which can be good. photo of the kitchen can show more than a full hallway. Look for cleanliness, fresh flowers if it's open, and how busy the place looks. Ask the waiter. It usually means they can cook few things well. A long one often means they try everything. You' be surprised how often they surprise you. Enjoy!",
